" Remove quotes '' and "" colors...
syn match   PlNoColor    '"'
syn match   PlNoColor    "'"
syn match   PlNoColor    "`"

hi  link  PlKeywords1 AllFilesSystemColor
syn keyword PlKeywords1       sub my use system

hi  link  PlKeywords2 AllFilesSystemColor2
syn keyword PlKeywords2    printf print exists

